  "body_text": "西安是我的第二故乡\n度过了青涩，懵懂的大学时光\n上一次来，还是2年前\n记得当时也是一个咖啡节\n但感觉现场氛围还比较冷清\n这次过来，感觉很好\n小慧，聂园和团子三个女孩子把一家小小店做的很有温度\n杯测活动中感受到很多萌芽中的种子\n也有了一些想法后面可以更好的输出配合\n努力吧，老少年，未来会更好！\n展会第一天（从凌晨开始），就碰到了熟悉的面孔\n就感觉很多缘分是冥冥中自有安排\n今天下来，试饮的方式有点问题\n明天调整下试饮模式，我们就改碗喝😄\n可以更好的介绍每只咖啡，以及我们的小周边\n（我们的袜子真的很好。。。看）\n欢迎看到推文的‘西安’朋友们来现场\nEthiopia Yirgacheffe Worka Anaerobica Natural\nEthiopia Sidama Bombe Anaerobic Natural\nEthiopia Sidama Shantawene Washed\nKenya Nyeri Thageini Super Natural\nChina Yunnan Puwen Flying Dragon SDN\nChina Yunnan Hongfeng SDN\nLucky Draw Light Blend\n最后，感谢东道主的各种安排，咖啡车，机器，甚至发放饭票还是头一遭\n到位！第一次感觉有点占展会方的便宜啊～😢\n晚安 or 早安\n现场见！",
  "body_html": "<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; \">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QYK7rvEobknhKUJsymw5aUcDAOvMeD8ZQfKCficdsEIx8CxszE1IK0ezk8t2ic5WtlL0KO0LYDG4UQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          西安是我的第二故乡\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          度过了青涩，懵懂的大学时光\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          上一次来，还是2年前\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          记得当时也是一个咖啡节\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          但感觉现场氛围还比较冷清\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QYK7rvEobknhKUJsymw5aUkp3tSpCK131bDZI2ibDdWAEAySy7ibgzJHBfxRPd9mo6mzpTtea2HhbA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          这次过来，感觉很好\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          小慧，聂园和团子三个女孩子把一家小小店做的很有温度\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          杯测活动中感受到很多萌芽中的种子\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          也有了一些想法后面可以更好的输出配合\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          努力吧，老少年，未来会更好！\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QYK7rvEobknhKUJsymw5aUug4GichCqovcPn4EGcOGwG5giawjTjJ1miaxt44R8x86RCw2mhL1dPQBQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          展会第一天（从凌晨开始），就碰到了熟悉的面孔\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          就感觉很多缘分是冥冥中自有安排\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          今天下来，试饮的方式有点问题\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          明天调整下试饮模式，我们就改碗喝😄\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          可以更好的介绍每只咖啡，以及我们的小周边\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          （我们的袜子真的很好。。。看）\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          欢迎看到推文的‘西安’朋友们来现场\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            Ethiopia Yirgacheffe Worka Anaerobica Natural\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            Ethiopia Sidama Bombe Anaerobic Natural\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            Ethiopia Sidama Shantawene Washed\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            Kenya Nyeri Thageini Super Natural\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            China Yunnan Puwen Flying Dragon SDN\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            China Yunnan Hongfeng SDN\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            Lucky Draw Light Blend\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          最后，感谢东道主的各种安排，咖啡车，机器，甚至发放饭票还是头一遭\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          到位！第一次感觉有点占展会方的便宜啊～😢\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QYK7rvEobknhKUJsymw5aUicv9fuo75VlG1WIds6W4ia2gdXbfB0HPvicHnBKxDuYmWc4Ny5na888kw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          晚安 or 早安\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          现场见！\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n</div>",
